## 🚀 **Overview**

**AetherPlayer** is a next-generation, AI-powered virtual studio and karaoke live streaming platform. Combining **real-time facial tracking**, **augmented reality effects**, **multi-format media playback**, and **professional live streaming** capabilities, it transforms your webcam into a fully-featured broadcast studio.

### ✨ **Key Features**

| Feature | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| 🎤 **Karaoke Mode** | Play video/audio files with synchronized lyrics (.lrc support) |
| 🤖 **AI Face Tracking** | Real-time facial landmark detection using MediaPipe |
| 🎭 **AR Effects** | Dynamic facial distortions, blush effects, and expression-based reactions |
| 📡 **Live Streaming** | RTMP streaming to platforms like YouTube, Facebook, Twitch |
| 🎵 **Multi-Format Support** | MP3, WAV, OGG, FLAC, MP4, AVI, MKV, MOV, WEBM |
| 🎬 **Video Overlay** | Picture-in-picture video playback with adjustable opacity |
| ⚙️ **Modern UI** | Dark mode interface with CustomTkinter |
| ⌨️ **Keyboard Shortcuts** | Space, S, L for quick control |
| 💾 **Settings Management** | Persistent URL and Stream Key storage |

