## 🎮 **Usage Guide**

### **Basic Controls**

| Action | Method |
|--------|--------|
| 🎵 Load Audio | Click "Pilih Audio" button |
| 🎬 Load Video | Click "Pilih Video (Karaoke)" button |
| ▶️ Play/Pause | Click "Play" button or press `Space` |
| ⏹️ Stop | Click "Stop" button or press `S` |
| 📡 Start/Stop Streaming | Click "GO LIVE" or press `L` |
| ⚙️ Settings | Click "Settings" button |
| ❌ Exit | Press `Q` |

### **AR Effects Guide**

The AI automatically detects your facial expressions and applies effects:

| Expression | Effect |
|------------|--------|
| 😍 **Smile (>3.2 ratio)** | Blush on cheeks |
| 🤨 **Raised eyebrows (>7px diff)** | Warp effect + "???" text |
| 😭 **Frown (<2.2 ratio)** | Tear drops + downward warp |
| 👑 **Nose up (<45%)** | "Sultan" warp effect |
| 🧠 **Blank (>3s no movement)** | "Loading... 404" + warp |

### **Lyrics File Format**

Create a `.lrc` file with the same name as your video/audio:

```lrc
[00:00.00] Judul Lagu - Artis
[00:05.00] 
[00:08.00] Di ujung jalan ini
[00:12.00] Ku teringat senyummu
[00:16.00] Yang dulu pernah ada
[00:20.00] Menemani langkahku
```

