## 🚨 **Troubleshooting**

### **Common Issues**

| Issue | Solution |
|-------|----------|
| ❌ FFmpeg not found | Download from [ffmpeg.org](https://ffmpeg.org/download.html) and place in project folder |
| ❌ Camera not working | Check camera permissions, try different camera index |
| ❌ No audio from video | Ensure FFmpeg is installed for audio extraction |
| ❌ Black screen on video | Check video codec support (H.264 recommended) |
| ❌ Streaming fails | Verify RTMP URL and Stream Key are correct |
| ❌ MediaPipe import error | Install `mediapipe==0.10.7` or use `cvzone` fallback |

### **Debug Mode**

```bash
# Enable debug logging
python main.py --debug

# Or modify main.py
DEBUG = True  # Add this line at the top
```

